// What the most one frame of each screen's opening does on a workspace of real size (real_size_wbtest.mbt), by window
// and screen: nodes of the window's tree made, laid out, words measured. Each the bar it may only fall from: one more
// than a tenth over it fails, and one more than a tenth under it until it is brought down here (the lines to write are
// printed by the test). Counted 2026-11-11 on the values of client/core-ts/test/real-size.ts; the chats' screens and
// those a mode puts a sheet or panel up on counted again that day, once the workspace was held as a device holds it (a
// chat asked `compact`, the sheet or panel reading the real values too).

// Raised once, 2026-11-17: 小屏 Home's list no longer opens under what is left up long (moved into 待处理, sfdesk
// open_jobs.mbt, its bell lit by the viewer's own): the chats' rows take the screen those groups took, so Home's opening,
// and each screen that opens over Home, makes, lays out and measures the rows of a screen more of chats (what each row
// is, unchanged); home-shared-bell, 待处理 open beside the wide bell, a state newly swept.

// Lowered, 2026-11-17: a run's first frame measures and lays out its words once, in the faces and lines they are drawn
// in (mbui ui's on_frame takes the faces given and the host's glyphs before the window's tree is laid out; the app's
// tree tells its looks, its faces and its lines as its window is first given, app_tree's app_looks_told), where it had
// laid out and measured all of them in the system's face and lines and then all again as the old frame gave them:
// every screen's laid and measured bars down (all of them, laid 995,593 -> 555,552, measured 208,147 -> 89,490),
// nothing made otherwise. settings-prices' tables' cells measured by the tree's own measurer (mbui View::tracks)
// count once: phone 272 -> 136 measured, wide 436 -> 166.
// Raised once, 2026-11-16: the board's cards say their chat as Home's list's rows do (sfpages board_node.mbt: the list's
// marks on its title's line, who is in it by row_aside_node, its menu), and its columns reach the window's foot (小屏
// under both bars, 中屏 and 大屏 to the panel's or the window's foot), so they make the cards a taller list shows: new
// parts seen, each made once (a face a box less than before, row_aside_node, Home's list's too).

// Raised once, 2026-11-15: a wide station's page's overview holds its terminals' 打开终端 row (sfpages
// station_terminals_node.mbt), a row of a new thing it shows, not more done for what it showed before.
// Again that day, a wide chat's screens: its side panel's bar made as nodes (sfdesk panel_bar_node.mbt), what its old
// view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown.
// Raised once, 2026-11-15: files-clash's dialog (sfdesk drag.mbt) made as nodes of the window's tree, what the old
// view built of it before (and measured as it drew) now made and measured in the tree's count.
// Again that day, a phone's film and song in the viewer: its player made as nodes (sf player_node.mbt), what its old
// view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown.
// Raised once, 2026-11-15: the wide stations' place made as nodes (sfdesk places.mbt stations_place_node), the station
// picked in it the same page as wide settings-station's, what its old view built now made in the tree's count.
// Lowered 2026-11-16, the wide window's: what the changes of one moment owe of what is under the pointer and what a
// still pointer is over settled once as of it (mbui's Tree::withins_owed_now), not laid out again for each change.
// Raised once, 2026-11-16: a new chat's model panel (sfpages model_triple.mbt): its body and foot made as nodes, what its
// old view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown; what the old
// view laid out again at each change of it is none now (real_size_change_known_wbtest.mbt, brought down).
// Raised once, 2026-11-16: the wide profiles' place opens on 概览 (sfpages profiles_overview.mbt) rather than an
// unanswered profile's waiting frame, showing the workspace's two-chart quota overview at once.

// Raised once, 2026-11-16: a phone's 用量 says under each of its figures what the core says there (缓存命中 87%, 日均
// 514 次: UsageTile `sub`, dropped by the shape before) and each row's line under its title whole on as many lines as it
// takes, its share at its bar's end: words a new thing it shows, not more done for what it showed before.

// Written again, 2026-11-17: 文件 and a station's drive made once as nodes on every screen (sfpages files_page_node.mbt,
// folder_node.mbt; the wide sidebar's 文件, sfdesk files_side_node.mbt), a reader's and a player's page over them too:
// what their old views built as they opened is made now, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown.

// Written again, 2026-11-15: 账号, 字体 and 下方栏 made once as nodes, and the settings' sidebar beside every settings
// page on a medium or large screen (sfdesk settings_frame.mbt settings_side_node): what their old views built is made
